RATES
Albite_custom
-start
10 k = 10
20 area = 1.0
30 rate = k * area * (1 - SR("Albite"))
40 save rate * TIME
-end

SOLUTION 1
temp 200
pH 2
Fe(+3) 4e-3
Fe(+2) 4e-3
Cl 1.0 charge

GAS_PHASE 1
-fixed_pressure
-pressure 5
H2S(g) 0.0

KINETICS 1
Albite_custom
-formula Albite 1.0
-m0 1.0
-m 1.0
-steps 1000 in 100
-cvode true

SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
-file result.sel
-reset false
-step true
-gas H2S(g)
END
